{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>Please note this game is in development\u2014its gameplay and features are constantly evolving. If something seems off or incomplete, it's likely a sign that changes are coming!</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fly With Friends</strong> is a social multiplayer flying game. Relax, explore, and fly...with friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TAKE TO THE SKIES!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the island and make new friends! Engage in epic aerial dogfights, blast balloons (or other players) with your egg cannon, and conquer nail-biting race courses! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529200/extras/gif1.gif?t=1741100506\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STYLE YOUR PILOT &amp; RIDE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Express yourself by decking out your egg pilot with a variety of cool skins and fun accessories. Earn a plane-load of money, unlock upgrades, and get tons of rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529200/extras/gif2.gif?t=1741100506\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DISCOVER THE ISLAND!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Land on a vibrant island teeming with hidden lore, quirky quests, and secret surprises. Uncover scattered lore markers and explore diverse landscapes that reveal the island\u2019s story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529200/extras/gif3.gif?t=1741100506\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PLAY WITH FRIENDS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join lively public or private lobbies to hang out with old friends and meet new ones from around the globe. Chat, collaborate, and share unforgettable adventures both in the skies and on the ground!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529200/extras/gif4.gif?t=1741100506\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Credits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trailer Music: Hunter Scott</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3529200?t=1741100506","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529200/85c603b2e0b05b999760f3a81c219c9aaa8857fe/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741100506","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529200/b27ccc77067973a2d8fc5dee80b24d0846750868/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741100506","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529200/b27ccc77067973a2d8fc5dee80b24d0846750868/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741100506","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>Please note this game is in development\u2014its gameplay and features are constantly evolving. If something seems off or incomplete, it's likely a sign that changes are coming!</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fly With Friends</strong> is a social multiplayer flying game. Relax, explore, and fly...with friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TAKE TO THE SKIES!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the island and make new friends! Engage in epic aerial dogfights, blast balloons (or other players) with your egg cannon, and conquer nail-biting race courses! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529200/extras/gif1.gif?t=1741100506\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STYLE YOUR PILOT &amp; RIDE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Express yourself by decking out your egg pilot with a variety of cool skins and fun accessories. Earn a plane-load of money, unlock upgrades, and get tons of rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529200/extras/gif2.gif?t=1741100506\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DISCOVER THE ISLAND!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Land on a vibrant island teeming with hidden lore, quirky quests, and secret surprises. Uncover scattered lore markers and explore diverse landscapes that reveal the island\u2019s story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529200/extras/gif3.gif?t=1741100506\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PLAY WITH FRIENDS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join lively public or private lobbies to hang out with old friends and meet new ones from around the globe. Chat, collaborate, and share unforgettable adventures both in the skies and on the ground!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529200/extras/gif4.gif?t=1741100506\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Credits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trailer Music: Hunter Scott</p>","developers":["Ace Pilot"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529200/7643df00e450f79a6ff5186483a86f58e6d58b74/header.jpg?t=1741100506","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257108387,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108387/movie480.mp4?t=1741100504","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108387/movie_max.mp4?t=1741100504"},"name":"Fly With Friends Announcement Trailer","thum